     Decisions made

     - Full 9-column build: Year, Growth, Revenue, Operating margin, EBIT,
       NOPAT, FCF,
       Discount factor, PV of FCF. This replaces the Year-1 build table, which
       becomes
       redundant.
     - Years as rows — scales to the 20-year horizon without the column count
       moving.
     - Net debt shown as a subtotal alongside the existing cash and debt lines,
       so no
       detail is lost.

