     New _projection_table(result) replacing _year_one_build(row), rendered
     above the
     bridge in the Valuation tab:

     - One row per forecast year, plus a footer terminal value row showing the
       Gordon
       Growth result and its present value.
     - A caption that prints the terminal value formula with this scenario's 
       numbers
       substituted — e.g. TV = $337.4B × 1.030 / (0.100 − 0.030) = $4,961B. That
       turns
       step 2 from an assertion into something visible on screen.
