        new).
     2. Restart the app; confirm HTTP 200.
     3. Drive the live server with gradio_client: three polylines present; point
        counts
        track the horizon slider; endpoint labels reconcile against run_dcf();
        hover bands
        equal the year count; guardrail returns the warning card.
     4. Confirm /config shows the new tab and three outputs on the valuate
        dependency.
     5. Confirm the Valuation and Sensitivity tabs are untouched — table still
        reconciles,
        heatmap still 63 cells / 9 bands.
     6. Re-run validate_palette.js on the shipped hexes for both themes and
        record the
        result.

